Staff details and event preparation

When your final attendee list is ready, submit the names using the Provide staff details link below.

Please submit your latest artwork using the Upload your logo link below. We request latest artwork from every participating organisation, as branding may have changed.

{NTE_VEHICLE_NOTE}For garage exhibits and large stands in the halls, setting up between 14:00-18:00 hrs on Sunday is required.

